      "content": "That's a good strategic breakdown, but I actually need you to write the specific draft of the response for the social media manager to post. \n\nLooking at the customer's tweet again, they seem pretty angry. I'm worried if we're too \"polite and grateful\" it might come across as dismissive of their $400 experience. But our client is also really sensitive about their brand image—they want the response to feel \"bright\" and \"upbeat\" about the future, even while apologizing.\n\nCan you give me a draft? Just try to find that balance between being sincere about the mistake and keeping the sentiment score in a healthy, positive range so it doesn't look like a total disaster on our analytics dashboard.",
